<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Virendrra Randive – Advisor & Entrepreneur</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Portfolio of Virendrra Randive – advisor and founder at Laxmi Jute House, helping businesses with sustainable gifting and growth."
  />

